      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "MOSS-Image follows long prompts and renders text in quotes. Zero dimensions use 1024 x 1024 and zero steps use 50 steps with guidance 3. The model environment needs orbitquant 0.14 or later, transformers 5.20 and diffusers 0.41; select its python_executable in the loader. keep_loaded keeps the model in its worker for the next run; profile model-offload keeps the components in host memory, int8-attention is faster and changes the image slightly. See the node README."
      ]
